#indent 4

//: # check/module/memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver
//: `Copy` / `Drop` / `Eq` / `Hash` operation ごとに、method body check と Drop check の[組/く]みを[作/つく]る checker-layer module です。
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - actual method body checker と Drop body checker が作る typed effect fact を、operation evidence producer へ渡す直前の check pair に束ねます。
//: - `Copy` は method body も Drop impl proof も必要としません。
//: - `Eq` / `Hash` は method body purity check を必要とし、Drop impl proof は必要としません。
//: - `Drop` は Drop impl proof を必要とし、method body purity check は必要としません。
//: - この operation matrix を 1 つの exhaustive match に固定し、後続の full orchestration が手書きで `NotRequired` や `Missing` を混ぜる退行を防ぎます。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - この module は `SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks` だけを返します。operation evidence record、producer input、aggregate proof status は作りません。
//: - `Present` / `Missing` / `Unknown` / `DropImplAbsent` / `DropImplPresent` は既存 resolver から得ます。この module が直接作る check は operation 上不要な `NotRequired` だけです。
//: - `Missing` / `Unknown` は status check であり、resolver error ではありません。これらを `Pure` や `DropImplAbsent` に畳みません。
//: - method body resolver または Drop impl resolver が duplicate、table read failure、push failure などの構造的不整合を返した場合だけ、payload 付き wrapper error として fail-closed に伝播します。
//: - `SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks` は resolver の返り値 payload 型として公開します。ただし facade へは出さず、repo 内の外部 module が struct constructor を直接呼ぶことは source policy で禁止します。
//: - accepted authority は session-local `SelfhostTypeId`、operation enum、typed effect check table、typed Drop body root id、typed surface state だけです。source text、span、lexeme、display name、diagnostic text、module path、HIR payload、Resource IR、backend artifact、proof store record、public surface hash を authority にしません。
//: - Drop fact は no-escape proof gate のために body root id を運びますが、この module は HIR arena を走査せず、root id から effect や proof status を推測しません。
//: - full public surface orchestration、actual expression method body checker、Drop body Resource IR proof、generic impl binder、private cache effect masking は後続 stage の責務です。
//:
//: [現状/げんじょう]:
//: - Phase 1 では method body resolver と Drop impl resolver の既存 table API を呼ぶだけです。
//: - table lookup は既存 resolver の内部表現に従い O(n) です。body check resolver 自体は table 表現を所有しないため、後続で resolver 内部を sorted index へ置き換えてもこの module の contract は変わりません。
//: - facade にはまだ re-export しません。full operation evidence orchestration が public impl header、classifier、body check pair、purity gate、impl table をまとめる段階で公開 API を再評価します。
//:
//: [計算量/けいさんりょう]:
//: - `Copy` は O(1) 時間・O(1) 追加空間です。
//: - `Eq` / `Hash` は method body fact 数 n に対して O(n) 時間、O(1) 追加空間です。
//: - `Drop` は Drop impl fact 数 n に対して O(n) 時間、O(1) 追加空間です。
//:
//: neplg2:test[stdio, normalize_newlines]
//: stdout: mlstr:
//: ##: Checked [ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok]
//: ##: [0] ok
//: ##: [1] ok
//: ##: [2] ok
//: ##: [3] ok
//: ##: [4] ok
//: ##: [5] ok
//: ##: [6] ok
//: ##: [7] ok
//: ##: [8] ok
//: ##: [9] ok
//: exit_code: 0
//: ```neplg2
//:| #entry main
//:| #target std
//:| #import "core/result" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/module/memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/module/memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/module/memo_trait_operation_drop_impl_resolver" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/module/memo_trait_operation_purity_gate" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_operation_evidence" as *
//:| #import "std/test" as *
//: fn main %impure fn void i32 \void:
//:     match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_stage0:
//:         Result::Ok summary:
//:             let checks0 checks_new
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_method_kind_eq summary.copy_checks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::NotRequired
//:             let checks2 checks_push checks1 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_drop_kind_eq summary.copy_checks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind::NotRequired
//:             let checks3 checks_push checks2 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_method_kind_eq summary.eq_present_checks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::Present
//:             let checks4 checks_push checks3 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_drop_kind_eq summary.eq_present_checks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind::NotRequired
//:             let checks5 checks_push checks4 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_method_kind_eq summary.hash_missing_checks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::Missing
//:             let checks6 checks_push checks5 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_method_kind_eq summary.method_unknown_checks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::Unknown
//:             let checks7 checks_push checks6 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_drop_kind_eq summary.drop_absent_checks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind::DropImplAbsent
//:             let checks8 checks_push checks7 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_drop_kind_eq summary.drop_unknown_checks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind::Unknown
//:             let checks9 checks_push checks8 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_error_result_eq summary.method_duplicate_rejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind::MethodBodyResolverRejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind::RecordDuplicate
//:             let checks10 checks_push checks9 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_error_result_eq summary.drop_duplicate_rejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind::DropImplResolverRejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropImplResolverErrorKind::RecordDuplicate
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks10
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//:         Result::Err _setup:
//:             let checks0 checks_new
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 Result::Err "body check resolver stage0 setup failed"
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks1
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//: ```

#import "core/result" as *
#import "core/traits/copy" as *
#import "core/math" as *
#import "neplg2/core/hir/hir" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/effect" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/id" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_operation_evidence" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_purity_gate" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_drop_impl_resolver" as *

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks: operation 別 method / Drop check pair
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - purity gate と impl candidate constructor に渡す 2 つの check を、同じ operation matrix から得た値として束ねます。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `method_body` は `SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck` です。
//: - `drop_impl` は `SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheck` です。
//: - この struct は evidence record ではありません。`Missing` / `Unknown` / `Impure` の解釈は後続の purity gate と solver が行います。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks:
    method_body %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck
    drop_impl %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheck

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind: body check resolver の構造的な拒否理由
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - method body resolver と Drop impl resolver の構造的 error を、どちらの resolver 由来か失わずに運びます。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `Missing` / `Unknown` は error ではなく check status です。
//: - payload は nested resolver error をそのまま保持します。表示用 string へ潰しません。
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind:
    MethodBodyResolverRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind
    DropImplResolverRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropImplResolverErrorKind

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverStage0Summary: body check resolver smoke の代表結果
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverStage0Summary:
    copy_checks %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind
    eq_present_checks %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind
    hash_missing_checks %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind
    method_unknown_checks %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind
    drop_absent_checks %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind
    drop_present_checks %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind
    drop_unknown_checks %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind
    method_duplicate_rejected %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind
    drop_duplicate_rejected %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverStage0Summary:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverStage0Summary \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverStage0Summary:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverStage0Summary \self:
        self

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_checks_new: method / Drop check pair を[作/つく]る private constructor
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - この constructor は operation matrix の内部でだけ使います。
//: - 外部 orchestration が arbitrary pair を手で組み立てると、`Copy` / `Eq` / `Hash` / `Drop` ごとの必要 check が崩れるため public API にはしません。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_checks_new %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks \method_body\drop_impl:
    SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks method_body drop_impl

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_method_not_required: method body 不要 check を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - この module が直接作る method check は `NotRequired` だけです。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_method_not_required %fn void SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck \void:
    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_check_new SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::NotRequired SelfhostEffectKind::Pure SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_drop_not_required: Drop 不要 check を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - この module が直接作る Drop check は `NotRequired` だけです。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_drop_not_required %fn void SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheck \void:
    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_drop_check_new SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind::NotRequired SelfhostEffectKind::Pure SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_method_error: nested method resolver error を[包/つつ]む
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_method_error %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind \error:
    SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind::MethodBodyResolverRejected error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_drop_error: nested Drop resolver error を[包/つつ]む
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_drop_error %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropImplResolverErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind \error:
    SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind::DropImplResolverRejected error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolve_copy: Copy operation の check pair を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolve_copy %fn void Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind \void:
    Result::Ok selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_checks_new selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_method_not_required selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_drop_not_required

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolve_method_operation: Eq / Hash operation の check pair を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - method body check は method body resolver から得ます。
//: - Drop check は operation 上不要なので `NotRequired` を直接作ります。
//: - method resolver が `Missing` / `Unknown` status を返した場合は成功値として保持し、wrapper error にはしません。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolve_method_operation %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable fn SelfhostTypeId fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind \method_surface\method_table\type_id\operation:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolve_result method_surface method_table type_id operation:
        Result::Ok method_body:
            Result::Ok selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_checks_new method_body selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_drop_not_required
        Result::Err method_error:
            Result::Err selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_method_error method_error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolve_drop_operation: Drop operation の check pair を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - method body check は operation 上不要なので `NotRequired` を直接作ります。
//: - Drop check は Drop impl resolver から得ます。
//: - Drop resolver が `Missing` / `Unknown` status を返した場合は成功値として保持し、wrapper error にはしません。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolve_drop_operation %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropImplSurfaceState fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropImplTable fn SelfhostTypeId Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind \drop_surface\drop_table\type_id:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_drop_impl_resolve_result drop_surface drop_table type_id:
        Result::Ok drop_impl:
            Result::Ok selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_checks_new selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_method_not_required drop_impl
        Result::Err drop_error:
            Result::Err selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_drop_error drop_error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolve_result: operation kind から必要な body check pair を[解決/かいけつ]する
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `Copy` では method table も Drop table も authority にしません。
//: - `Eq` / `Hash` では method resolver だけを呼び、Drop resolver は呼びません。
//: - `Drop` では Drop impl resolver だけを呼び、method table lookup は行いません。
//: - operation matrix は exhaustive match で管理し、variant 追加時にはこの関数が更新対象になります。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolve_result %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodySurfaceState fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropImplSurfaceState fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropImplTable fn SelfhostTypeId fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind \method_surface\method_table\drop_surface\drop_table\type_id\operation:
    match operation:
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Copy:
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolve_copy
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Drop:
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolve_drop_operation drop_surface drop_table type_id
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Eq:
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolve_method_operation method_surface method_table type_id operation
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Hash:
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolve_method_operation method_surface method_table type_id operation

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_error_kind_eq: wrapper error が同じ分類か[返/かえ]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - nested resolver error は nested equality helper で payload まで比較します。
//: - wildcard arm は使いません。error variant が増えた場合はこの equality 境界を明示的に更新します。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_error_kind_eq %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind bool \a\b:
    match a:
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind::MethodBodyResolverRejected a_method:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind::MethodBodyResolverRejected b_method:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver_error_kind_eq a_method b_method
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind::DropImplResolverRejected _b_drop:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind::DropImplResolverRejected a_drop:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind::MethodBodyResolverRejected _b_method:
                    false
                SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind::DropImplResolverRejected b_drop:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_drop_impl_resolver_error_kind_eq a_drop b_drop

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_method_check_kind_code: method check kind を比較用 code へ[写/うつ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_method_check_kind_code %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind i32 \kind:
    match kind:
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::Present:
            0
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::Missing:
            1
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::Unknown:
            2
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind::NotRequired:
            3

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_drop_check_kind_code: Drop check kind を比較用 code へ[写/うつ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_drop_check_kind_code %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind i32 \kind:
    match kind:
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind::DropImplAbsent:
            0
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind::DropImplPresent:
            1
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind::Missing:
            2
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind::Unknown:
            3
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind::NotRequired:
            4

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_method_check_kind_eq: method check kind が同じ variant か[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_method_check_kind_eq %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind bool \a\b:
    eq selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_method_check_kind_code a selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_method_check_kind_code b

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_drop_check_kind_eq: Drop check kind が同じ variant か[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_drop_check_kind_eq %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind bool \a\b:
    eq selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_drop_check_kind_code a selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_drop_check_kind_code b

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_method_kind_eq: result の method check kind が期待通りか[確認/かくにん]する
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_method_kind_eq %fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheckKind bool \result\expected:
    match result:
        Result::Ok checks:
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_method_check_kind_eq checks.method_body.kind expected
        Result::Err _e:
            false

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_drop_kind_eq: result の Drop check kind が期待通りか[確認/かくにん]する
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_drop_kind_eq %fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationDropCheckKind bool \result\expected:
    match result:
        Result::Ok checks:
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_drop_check_kind_eq checks.drop_impl.kind expected
        Result::Err _e:
            false

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_error_result_eq: result が期待 error か[確認/かくにん]する
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_error_result_eq %fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind bool \result\expected:
    match result:
        Result::Ok _checks:
            false
        Result::Err e:
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_error_kind_eq e expected

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_stage0_summary_new: stage0 summary を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_stage0_summary_new %fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind fn Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyChecks SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverStage0Summary \copy_checks\eq_present_checks\hash_missing_checks\method_unknown_checks\drop_absent_checks\drop_present_checks\drop_unknown_checks\method_duplicate_rejected\drop_duplicate_rejected:
    SelfhostMemoTraitOperationBodyCheckResolverStage0Summary copy_checks eq_present_checks hash_missing_checks method_unknown_checks drop_absent_checks drop_present_checks drop_unknown_checks method_duplicate_rejected drop_duplicate_rejected

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_body_check_resolver_stage0_finish: owner table を[閉/と]じて summary を[返/かえ]す
